---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { company } from '../config';
---
<Base title="Privacy notice" description="How DNA Engineering handles personal information.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
      <!-- TODO(Dan): check this fits how you actually handle data. Get it reviewed if unsure. -->
      <p>{company.legalName} is the data controller for personal information collected through this website.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>If you contact us, we keep your name, company, contact details and message so we can reply and, if you go ahead, carry out the work.</p>
      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>Enquiries that don't lead to work are deleted within 12 months. Records relating to contracts are kept as long as the law requires.</p>
      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>This site doesn't use tracking or advertising cookies.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete the information we hold about you{company.email ? <> by emailing <a href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>{company.email}</a></> : ''}. You can also complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at ico.org.uk.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
